<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Airborne Freight started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Airborne Freight started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said it started coverage of Airborne Freight Corp with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/8 to 20-3/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
